PR #98 conflicted with `main` due to diverging changes in `badgeTimeCountryInfo`. The PR branch returned only a flag for selections; `main` already included the country name alongside the flag (consistent with clubs).

## Resolution

- Accepted `origin/main` version of `badgeTimeCountryInfo` for `selecoes`:

```js
// Before (PR branch — flag only, no country name)
const d = SELECAO_PAIS[timeId] || {};
if (!d.pais) return '';
return `...${flagImg(d.pais, 20)}</div>`;

// After (main — flag + country name, consistent with clubs)
const d = SELECAO_PAIS[timeId] || { pais:'', paisNome: nomeTime||'' };
if (!d.pais) return '';
return `...${flagImg(d.pais, 20)}<span ...>${d.paisNome}</span></div>`;
```

- Merged all additional changes from `main` (multi-select dropdowns for country/efficiency filters, `stopPropagation` fixes, `_paisFiltroTimesSet` refactor) without modification.
